cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this work supports a publication, cite it as below."
title: "DEX ARM 01: Open-Source 7-Axis Manipulator & 20-DoF Biomimetic Tendon Hand Lab"
abstract: >-
  A 7-axis robotic manipulator with a 20-DoF biomimetic tendon-driven hand, including
  damped least-squares inverse kinematics, grasp-wrench telemetry, a six-stage
  minimum-jerk grasp planner, a browser MuJoCo WebAssembly physics runtime, WebXR
  hand teleoperation, Hugging Face LeRobot ACT imitation learning, and ROS 2 export.
authors:
  - family-names: Shah
    given-names: Salik
