license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
keywords:
  - dexterous manipulation
  - tendon-driven hand
  - robotic arm
  - inverse kinematics
  - MuJoCo
  - WebXR
  - robot learning
  - imitation learning
  - LeRobot
  - ACT policy
  - ROS 2
type: software
